    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d661">

                <pb facs="0890" n="820" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg820"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Pruyn.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 8.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1862-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 11, 1862.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> Herewith I transmit a sealed communication,
                    addressed to their excellencies the ministers for foreign affairs of his
                    Imperial Majesty the Tycoon of Japan, in answer to one from them on the subject
                    of the retirement of your predecessor from the mission to that empire. I enclose
                    for your information a transcript of this communication, and request that you
                    will place the original in the hands of their excellencies without delay.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert H. Pruyn,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c. Yedo.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
